---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import ComparisonTable from "../components/ComparisonTable.astro";
import StickyBuyCta from "../components/StickyBuyCta.astro";

const buyUrl = "https://wiggjamie.gumroad.com/l/rhythmix-studio";
---
<Base
  title="RHYTHMIX vs LANDR — Mastering + distribution + AI generation, one payment"
  description="LANDR is the gold standard for AI mastering and distribution — but it can't generate music and the subscription never stops. RHYTHMIX bundles all three for $149 once."
  url="https://rhythmixapp.com.au/vs-landr"
>
  <section class="text-center px-6 pt-16 pb-10" style="background:radial-gradient(ellipse 80% 50% at 50% 0%,rgba(124,58,237,.18),transparent);">
    <a href="/compare" class="text-[#555] text-[11px] font-bold tracking-[3px] uppercase no-underline hover:text-[#a0a0b0]">← All comparisons</a>
    <h1 class="font-black leading-[1.05] tracking-[-1.5px] mt-6 mb-5" style="font-size:clamp(36px,8vw,64px);">
      RHYTHMIX vs <em class="brand-gradient-text not-italic">LANDR.</em>
    </h1>
    <p class="text-[#a0a0b0] leading-relaxed max-w-[640px] mx-auto" style="font-size:clamp(15px,2.5vw,18px);">
      LANDR built the AI mastering category and runs one of the cleanest distribution pipelines around. It also can't generate music — and the subscription clock never stops. <strong class="text-white">Here's the honest read.</strong>
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="px-6 pb-12 max-w-[820px] mx-auto">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-3 mb-10">
      <div class="rounded-2xl bg-[#0d0d0d] border border-white/[.08] px-5 py-5">
        <div class="text-[11px] font-bold tracking-[2px] uppercase text-[#555] mb-1.5">Sticker price</div>
        <div class="text-2xl font-black brand-gradient-text">$149 once</div>
        <div class="text-[#555] text-xs mt-1">vs LANDR Pro $25/mo</div>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-2xl bg-[#0d0d0d] border border-white/[.08] px-5 py-5">
        <div class="text-[11px] font-bold tracking-[2px] uppercase text-[#555] mb-1.5">Generation</div>
        <div class="text-2xl font-black text-white">Included</div>
        <div class="text-[#555] text-xs mt-1">LANDR: not offered</div>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-2xl bg-[#0d0d0d] border border-white/[.08] px-5 py-5">
        <div class="text-[11px] font-bold tracking-[2px] uppercase text-[#555] mb-1.5">Break-even</div>
        <div class="text-2xl font-black text-white">6 months</div>
        <div class="text-[#555] text-xs mt-1">Then free, forever</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <ComparisonTable show={["landr"]} />
  </section>

  <section class="px-6 pb-16 max-w-[760px] mx-auto">
    <div class="text-[11px] font-bold tracking-[4px] uppercase text-[#7c3aed] mb-3 text-center">The honest verdict</div>
    <h2 class="font-black leading-[1.1] mb-9 text-center" style="font-size:clamp(26px,5vw,36px);">When LANDR is actually the better pick</h2>
    <div class="rounded-[20px] px-6 py-7 border border-white/[.08] bg-[#0d0d0d] mb-3.5">
      <h3 class="text-lg font-extrabold mb-2">You record your own music and only need post-production</h3>
      <p class="text-[#a0a0b0] text-sm leading-relaxed">If you're a band, a session musician, or you produce in Ableton / FL Studio / Logic and just need mastering + distribution at the end, LANDR is purpose-built for exactly that workflow.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="rounded-[20px] px-6 py-7 border border-white/[.08] bg-[#0d0d0d] mb-3.5">
      <h3 class="text-lg font-extrabold mb-2">You need their plugin ecosystem</h3>
      <p class="text-[#a0a0b0] text-sm leading-relaxed">LANDR Studio's plugin suite (Bus 1, FX Voice, etc.) is genuinely strong. If those are part of your DAW workflow, that subscription buys real tools.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="rounded-[20px] px-6 py-7 border border-white/[.08] bg-[#0d0d0d]">
      <h3 class="text-lg font-extrabold mb-2">Your label requires LANDR's mastering specifically</h3>
      <p class="text-[#a0a0b0] text-sm leading-relaxed">A few sync libraries and label deals are wired specifically into LANDR's mastering pipeline. If you have one of those contracts, stay where you are.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="px-6 pb-16 max-w-[760px] mx-auto">
    <div class="text-[11px] font-bold tracking-[4px] uppercase text-[#f5c000] mb-3 text-center">Where RHYTHMIX wins</div>
    <h2 class="font-black leading-[1.1] mb-9 text-center" style="font-size:clamp(26px,5vw,36px);">Why people leave LANDR</h2>
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-3">
      <div class="rounded-[20px] px-6 py-6 border border-[rgba(245,192,0,.25)]" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(245,192,0,.08),rgba(245,192,0,.02));">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-extrabold mb-1.5">🎵 Generation, not just post-production</h3>
        <p class="text-[#a0a0b0] text-sm leading-relaxed">LANDR can't make a song. RHYTHMIX writes, masters, and ships it. If you don't have a DAW and a vocal mic, LANDR alone is half a workflow.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-[20px] px-6 py-6 border border-[rgba(0,232,135,.25)]" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(0,232,135,.08),rgba(0,232,135,.02));">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-extrabold mb-1.5">💰 LANDR Pro is $300/year</h3>
        <p class="text-[#a0a0b0] text-sm leading-relaxed">Six months of LANDR Pro pays for RHYTHMIX outright. After year 2 you've kept $451. After year 5, $1,351.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-[20px] px-6 py-6 border border-[rgba(124,58,237,.3)]" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(124,58,237,.1),rgba(124,58,237,.02));">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-extrabold mb-1.5">📱 One workflow, not three tabs</h3>
        <p class="text-[#a0a0b0] text-sm leading-relaxed">LANDR + Suno + DistroKid is three logins, three subscriptions, three places where things go wrong. RHYTHMIX is one app, one tap.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="px-6 pb-24 max-w-[700px] mx-auto">
    <div class="border border-[rgba(124,58,237,.3)] rounded-3xl px-7 py-12 text-center" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0d0020,#000);">
      <h2 class="font-black mb-3" style="font-size:clamp(28px,6vw,42px);">Skip the LANDR tax.</h2>
      <p class="text-[#a0a0b0] text-base mb-7 max-w-[480px] mx-auto leading-relaxed">30-day money-back guarantee. Test the full pipeline. Refund instantly if it's not the upgrade.</p>
      <a href={buyUrl} class="gold-gradient text-black text-xl font-black px-10 py-[22px] rounded-2xl no-underline inline-block" style="box-shadow:0 0 30px rgba(245,192,0,.25);">Try RHYTHMIX — $149 →</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <StickyBuyCta href={buyUrl} />
</Base>
